        },
        {
          "name": "get_setup",
          "description": "Retrieve setup/prerequisite excerpts and JSON configuration examples from a listing\u2019s directory-supplied README, plus documentation links and next steps. Returns links_only when no supported excerpt is available. Examples are source data, not verified commands; review credentials and prerequisites before use. Does not fetch provider endpoints or modify client configuration.",
